  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi lực căng của mỗi nửa sợi dây là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>T</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>T</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>T</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là hợp lực của hai lực này.<br>\n\t\t\tTa minh họa các lực tác dụng lên vật theo hình vẽ bên.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover><mi>g</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>92</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>\n\t\t\tTa lại có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>92</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tÁp dụng hệ thức lượng trong tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>⇒</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy lực căng của mỗi nửa sợi dây là khoảng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b5846ae83f6f8a882bf027433a47a1bcf95c3aef9f4a7b114a9da892a525d434.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh 